    "body": "Add an independent, default-off Better Targeting setting.\\n\\nWhile the battle target selector is active:\\n- Do not draw the large red Target text over actors that are not selected.\\n- Draw the selected target's pointer hand at full opacity.\\n- Preserve target selection, valid-target rules, colors, and input behavior.\\n\\nPlayer check:\\n- Select commands that target one enemy, one ally, all enemies, and all allies.\\n- Confirm non-targets have no red Target label.\\n- Confirm every selected target has a fully opaque pointer.\\n- Confirm selection and command execution remain unchanged.",
